// M8f1 exit scenario (TODO B13; docs/plans/M8F1-INFANTRY-AI.md §6): the village of `m8b-ambush`,
// held by Red infantry with RPGs in the houses and a missile team on the east edge, now with a
// Blue mechanised platoon beside the tanks. Play as Blue: dismount the M2s short of the village
// (plan action DISMOUNT), send the squads in first (OCCUPY BUILDINGS FACING west), and bring the
// tanks forward behind them. Tank-only platoons route round the village unless a leg says
// BUILT-UP ENTER; squads on the ground within 300 m lift that. Red has no commander AI: its squads
// hold their houses and move house after firing twice.
(
    id: "m8f-ambush",
    name: "CLEARING THE VILLAGE",
    date: (1987, 6, 15),
    start_time_s: 36000, // 10:00
    map: (id: "demo", recipe: "rolling-farmland", seed: 42, size_m: 8000.0),
    seed: 12,
    briefing: "SITUATION: RED INFANTRY WITH ANTI-TANK WEAPONS HOLDS THE VILLAGE 2 KM WEST. A MISSILE TEAM IS REPORTED ON THE EAST EDGE.\n\nMISSION: 1ST TANK PLATOON AND 3RD MECHANISED PLATOON CLEAR THE VILLAGE WITHIN 40 MINUTES.\n\nNOTES: DISMOUNT SHORT OF THE VILLAGE AND LET THE SQUADS LEAD. TANKS OVERWATCH FROM STAND-OFF AND FOLLOW THE SQUADS IN. RPG TEAMS IN HOUSES WAIT FOR A FLANK SHOT INSIDE 200 M.",
    objectives: [(name: "VILLAGE", centre: (4560.0, 4310.0), radius_m: 300.0)],
    victory: (time_limit_s: 2400.0, objective: "VILLAGE", attacker: 0, destroyed_fraction: 0.75),
